  "question": {
    "text": "Calculate the number of hours of service that can be derived at 1 atm,&nbsp;<math><mn>300&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> from an acetylene lamp containing <math><mn>640</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> calcium carbide. Given that the lamp requires <math><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math> acetylene gas at 1 atm <math><mn>300&nbsp;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> for one hour. [Take <math><mn>0.0821</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>300</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>25]</mn></math>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mtext><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mtext><msub><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mtext></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />moles of <math> <mrow> <mtext>C</mtext><mtext>a</mtext><msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo><mfrac> <mrow> <mn>640</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>64</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mo>∴</mo> </math> moles of C<sub>2</sub>H<sub>2</sub> formed = 10<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo><msub> <mrow> <mtext>&nbsp;&nbsp;V</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>C</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <msub> <mtext>H</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msub> </mrow> </msub> </mrow> </math> = 10 × 0.0821 × 300 = 250 Litres<br /><br /><math> <mo>∴</mo> </math> number of hours = <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>250</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>50</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn> </mrow> </math>"
  }
